; A norm-certified existential is equivalent to a proved finite search
; over four signed coordinate representatives, for every equivalence-
; preserving property with actual pointwise proposition cases.
; Both search/witness directions retain real norm/equivalence evidence.
; This is a constructive proof in Prop, without a search or choice oracle.
